msgctxt "quest/005/ManFst313_00517:TEXT_MANFST313_00517_RASHAHT_000_010:1"
msgid "<if ($gn52 > 0)>It is good to see you, <capitalize><if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 8></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 8></if><if ($gn54 > 0)><sheet GCRankUldahMaleText $gn54 8></if></capitalize> <split \" \" 2><string $gs1></split><else><if ($gn53 > 0)>Thank you for coming, <split \" \" 1><string $gs1></split><else>Thank you for coming, <split \" \" 1><string $gs1></split></if></if>. Word of your triumph reached me some while ago, but I am pleased to have it personally confirmed."
msgstr ""

#. ja: イフリートに続いて、タイタン討伐にまで成功するなんて、<br>キミって、ほんとにすっごい冒険者なんだねッ！<br>エオルゼアの英雄と言っても、過言じゃないよ！
#. de: Zuerst Ifrit und jetzt auch noch Titan! Du bist fürwahr <if $gn4>keine gewöhnliche Abenteurerin<else>kein gewöhnlicher Abenteurer</if>. Nein, du bist <if $gn4>eine wahre Heldin<else>ein wahrer Held</if>, <if $gn4>die<else>der</if> die Geschichte Eorzeas prägt!
#. fr: Ifrit et maintenant Titan... Tu es un<if $gn4>e</if> véritable <if $gn4>sauveuse<else>héros</if><nbsp>! Les habitants de Limsa Lominsa te seront à jamais rrredevables.
#. speaker: RASHAHT
#. macro: <if ($gn52 > 0)>Suffice it to say, we are glad to have a Scion in our ranks<else><if ($gn53 > 0)>The people of Limsa Lominsa are forever in your debt<else>The p… — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 52 (the player's rank in the Maelstrom, 0 when not a member) > 0 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($gn53 > 0)>The people of Limsa Lominsa are forever in your debt<else>The people of Limsa Lominsa are forever in your debt</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 53 (the player's rank in the Order of the Twin Adder, 0 when not a member) > 0 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "quest/005/ManFst313_00517:TEXT_MANFST313_00517_RASHAHT_000_011:1"
msgid "First Ifrit and now Titan... Truly, when I think of your achievements, I feel the loss of the Warriors of Light less keenly─and there can be no greater compliment than that. You and your order are heroes. <if ($gn52 > 0)>Suffice it to say, we are glad to have a Scion in our ranks<else><if ($gn53 > 0)>The people of Limsa Lominsa are forever in your debt<else>The people of Limsa Lominsa are forever in your debt</if></if>."
msgstr ""

#. ja: タイタン討伐とその報告、ご苦労さま！<br>「暁」のみんなにも、よろしく伝えてねッ！
#. de: Danke für diesen höchst erfreulichen Bericht. Bitte, richte dem Bund der Morgenröte meine ehrerbietigsten Grüße aus.
#. fr: Je vais mettre au courant l'Amirale de tes exploits. Transmets mes amitiés aux autres Hérrritiers, veux-tu<nbsp>?
#. speaker: RASHAHT
#. macro: <if ($gn52 > 0)> Until next time, <capitalize><if ($gn52 > 0)><sheet GCRankLimsaMaleText $gn52 8></if><if ($gn53 > 0)><sheet GCRankGridaniaMaleText $gn53 8></if… — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 52 (the player's rank in the Maelstrom, 0 when not a member) > 0 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
